  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Existing Endpoints**\n\nI\'ve been examining the existing API endpoints implemented in `server.ts`. Currently, `/api/project-templates` and `/api/projects/from-template` (Feature 2 Project Templates) are operational, along with `/api/meeting-notes` (Feature 3 Meeting Notes) and `/api/collaboration/standup` (Feature 11 Daily Stand-up). My focus is now on understanding their structure and functionality.\n\n\n"
