  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Calendar Views**\n\nI\'m focusing on integrating a Calendar View and a Timeline/Gantt View into `TasksPage.tsx`, specifically after line 855. The calendar functionality will include navigation, an export button to download an .ics file, and a 7-day header. This is the first step in adding calendar functionality, and will build the foundation for further integrations.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_484578"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add Calendar View and Timeline Gantt View to TasksPage.tsx\", \"EndLine\":856, \"Instruction\":\"Add Calendar and Timeline views after list view\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"      )}\\n\\n      {/* VIEW MODE 4: INTERACTIVE CALENDAR VIEW */}\\n      {viewMode === \'calendar\' && (\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs p-5 space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-3 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <h2 className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <Calendar className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-blue-600\\\" />\\n                <span>Deliverables & Sprint Milestones Calendar</span>\\n              </h2>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n                Visualizing task completion commitments by delivery deadline.\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <a\\n              href={api.getCalendarExportUrl(selectedProjectId || undefined)}\\n              download=\\\"equinox_schedule.ics\\\"\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg transition-colors self-start sm:self-auto\\\"\\n            >\\n              <Calendar className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-600\\\" />\\n              <span>Export iCal (.ics)</span>\\n            </a>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Calendar Grid */}\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-7 gap-px bg-slate-200 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden text-xs\\\">\\n            {[\'Sun\', \'Mon\', \'Tue\', \'Wed\', \'Thu\', \'Fri\', \'Sat\'].map((d) => (\\n              <div key={d} className=\\\"bg-slate-50 p-2 text-center font-bold text-slate-600 text-[11px]\\\">\\n                {d}\\n              </div>\\n            ))}\\n\\n            {/* Days generator for October 2026 (matching project dates) */}\\n            {Array.from({ length: 35 }).map((_, i) => {\\n              // Day offset: Oct 1 2026 is a Thursday (index 4)\\n              const dayNum = i - 3;\\n              const isCurrentMonth = dayNum >= 1 && dayNum <= 31;\\n              const dayStr = isCurrentMonth\\n                ? `2026-10-${dayNum < 10 ? \'0\' + dayNum : dayNum}`\\n                : \'\';\\n              const dayTasks = sortedTasks.filter((t) => t.due_date === dayStr);\\n\\n              return (\\n                <div\\n                  key={i}\\n                  className={`min-h-[90px] p-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between transition-colors ${\\n                    isCurrentMonth ? \'bg-white hover:bg-slate-50/50\' : \'bg-slate-100/60 text-slate-400\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold text-slate-500\\\">\\n                    <span>{isCurrentMonth ? dayNum : \'\'}</span>\\n                    {dayTasks.length > 0 && (\\n                      <span className=\\\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-[9px] flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">\\n                        {dayTasks.length}\\n                      </span>\\n                    )}\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"space-y-1 mt-1 flex-1 overflow-y-auto max-h-20\\\">\\n                    {dayTasks.map((t) => {\\n                      const overdue = isTaskOverdue({ status: t.status, dueDate: t.due_date }, now);\\n                      return (\\n                        <div\\n                          key={t.id}\\n                          onClick={() => setInspectingTask(t)}\\n                          className={`p-1 rounded text-[10px] cursor-pointer truncate font-medium border ${\\n                            t.status === \'Done\'\\n                              ? \'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border-emerald-200 line-through\'\\n                              : overdue\\n                              ? \'bg-rose-50 text-rose-800 border-rose-200 font-bold\'\\n                              : t.priority === \'High\'\\n                              ? \'bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 border-amber-200\'\\n                              : \'bg-blue-50 text-blue-800 border-blue-200\'\\n                          }`}\\n                          title={`${t.issue_key || \'TASK\'}: ${t.title}`}\\n                        >\\n                          <span className=\\\"font-mono font-bold mr-1\\\">{t.issue_key || \'TSK\'}:</span>\\n                          <span>{t.title}</span>\\n                        </div>\\n                      );\\n                    })}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              );\\n            })}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* VIEW MODE 5: TIMELINE & GANTT VIEW */}\\n      {viewMode === \'timeline\' && (\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs p-5 space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-3 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <h2 className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <Clock className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-purple-600\\\" />\\n                <span>Sprint Timeline & Dependency Gantt Chart</span>\\n              </h2>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n                Tracking critical path pacing, prerequisite dependencies, and delivery windows.\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-emerald-700\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"w-3 h-3 rounded bg-emerald-500\\\"></span>\\n                <span>Done</span>\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-blue-700\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"w-3 h-3 rounded bg-blue-500\\\"></span>\\n                <span>In Progress</span>\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-slate-600\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"w-3 h-3 rounded bg-slate-300\\\"></span>\\n                <span>To Do</span>\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"divide-y divide-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\\\">\\n            {sortedTasks.map((t) => {\\n              const assignee = team.find((m) => m.id === t.assignee_id);\\n              const isHigh = t.priority === \'High\';\\n              const isBlocked = Boolean(t.is_blocked);\\n\\n              return (\\n                <div\\n                  key={t.id}\\n                  onClick={() => setInspectingTask(t)}\\n                  className=\\\"p-3.5 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors cursor-pointer flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 min-w-0 md:w-1/2\\\">\\n                    {getIssueTypeIcon(t.issue_type)}\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-mono font-bold text-blue-600 shrink-0\\\">\\n                      {t.issue_key || \'EQX-100\'}\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-slate-900 truncate\\\">{t.title}</span>\\n                    {isBlocked && (\\n                      <span className=\\\"px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-rose-100 text-rose-700 shrink-0\\\">\\n                        BLOCKED\\n                      </span>\\n                    )}\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 shrink-0 md:w-1/2 justify-between md:justify-end\\\">\\n                    {assignee ? (\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\" title={assignee.name}>\\n                        <img\\n                          src={assignee.avatar_url || `https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/initials/svg?seed=${assignee.name}`}\\n                          alt={assignee.name}\\n                          className=\\\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full object-cover\\\"\\n                        />\\n                        <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-600 truncate max-w-[80px]\\\">\\n                          {assignee.name.split(\' \')[0]}\\n                        </span>\\n                      </div>\\n                    ) : (\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">Unassigned</span>\\n                    )}\\n\\n                    {/* Timeline Bar representation */}\\n                    <div className=\\\"w-36 bg-slate-100 h-6 rounded-md overflow-hidden relative border border-slate-200\\\">\\n                      <div\\n                        className={`h-full flex items-center px-2 text-[10px] font-bold text-white transition-all ${\\n                          t.status === \'Done\'\\n                            ? \'w-full bg-emerald-600\'\\n                            : t.status === \'In Progress\'\\n                            ? \'w-2/3 bg-blue-600\'\\n                            : t.status === \'In Review\'\\n                            ? \'w-5/6 bg-amber-500\'\\n                            : \'w-1/3 bg-slate-400\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">{t.status}</span>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 w-24 text-right\\\">\\n                      {t.due_date || \'No Date\'}\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              );\\n            })}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\", \"StartLine\":855, \"TargetContent\":\"      )}\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/tasks/TasksPage.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Editing file\", \"toolSummary\":\"Add Calendar and Timeline views in TasksPage.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\317\b\n\314\b\001i\024}\023\2603\316\220\030N\324\312\"[(\006\030\236[;\323\345\v+U\374\257w\337A\026\202\321,\036\003\244\037{Qe\366\225%q!5\0267\351L[\302m\223G\"\001\257\366sQ\204,<\2317G\206\362L\000&\030\376;\330\001D\336\023\323Qc\362\332\360\226V\034Nk\370\371^n\026-\022L\301\316q\211l\207\350\221\201%Q9\v\2203\020x[\303\366C{\332\rJ\322F\\\340\245N\266Y\346(\255\327\f{\314\033G\311kGBGg\3506=\234\300\232n?\236\367\315\270\345N\035<\233@L\327\372+\214\375\0256>eUd\aF\021TM\2235\362`\344\200\312\251\314\272=\003\273\231\025\204d\001\341\254Yslc\336\3614\000\205{\017\031D\2103\267!\"\375\315\203\032#Esx\205\t\234\'\352\343\302\236\373&\255\vRs9?\214\305\351f\264\363_\251+\336\300e\003\037\222\000>\001;\234\306\314M\r\241\030x\350_*P\215\003\333~\006\200\332\024\304\312mdG#\340\243\241\311\205\3360\305e[[}\304}\267\306\252 \326\255\200\376\225\210\373.\361\330N1C\301\316i\205y^\\e\304\373Edp3a\343=\271\217\341\005G\230f\316\0210\346\305\a\357\376\003@\\\245?J\304\207\002\262\201\223A\350\234~u\362\263\250%\a\214\357A\3225]\203\232\334\'\330\223\0056\205\333\331\2248\334\244\225\243\b\327\354\350i>\371\021\367\211\270\030\234\262\340aF\255V(h\212S\250\220&--k\375.Ax\237Y\253\204\375\263\374[\210\303\377\323T!\243I\020\203\246\351\0369%@\212\357\266\370\300T\364\300,\343\233z\3221\245\017\0063\327\346\361\200\347\251\350$?[>\332\266\325\322>\305<\336\366\250\373\304\017\n\271\035\305;\225\342\177CS\234pU\305\035\032l\363\200 \307\255\241i\002\257\226\\\003\345\220\367\206\304\340\220 \261\341\204\r\234\034\327&\277\2258\017\376\315\315\263\016\251\036>\364\345\330\342\302\327\325\032\300\220\200\232A\006&\341XP\273\202\214ow\030\0006\035\322\332`\351Qa\216\222n\220\230\264\320\231\353\201\233\313\006Hk\246z\335l\250uh\336!t\'<\211\211\355\021\265#\314Q=(\357J\324-Q-\264[/R\024\223\365M\315\235\213J(D\201\024kVA\321B\b]e\353:bS\237\340L\246\223\002\350N\350\277\'\022\265\025\365\023\206T\323W\205\a3\f\203y/\367\342k\031\325;fi\347\23