  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **User Request**: The user provided an 18-category feature matrix for their project management and contribution platform (Equinox / PULSE): User & Access Management, Project Management, Team Management & Collaboration, Task & Workflow Management, Milestones & Scheduling, Contribution Tracking, Fair Contribution Analysis, Team Workload & Skills, Project Health Analytics, Risk & Bottleneck Intelligence, AI Assistant & Automation, Simulation & Project Recovery, Learning & Continuous Improvement, Dashboards & Reporting, Notifications & Communication, Integrations, Security & Privacy, Advanced Features. The user instructed: analyze which features are already implemented, ignore duplicates, and implement all remaining missing features.\n   - **Constraints**: Node.js 22 runtime, Express full-stack on port 3000, Vite React SPA frontend, Tailwind CSS, SQLite database via `sql.js`, no mock fallback when real data/routes can be wired. Strict verification with `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Backend (`/server.ts`)**:\n     - Added tables in SQLite `initDatabase()`: `discussions`, `peer_kudos`, `task_attachments`, `system_settings`.\n     - Seeded sample data for discussions, peer kudos (invisible work recognition), and task attachments.\n     - Added backend API endpoints:\n       - `POST /api/auth/reset-password`\n       - `PUT /api/auth/profile`\n       - `GET / POST /api/invitations`\n       - `GET / POST /api/discussions`\n       - `GET / POST /api/kudos`\n       - `GET / POST / DELETE /api/tasks/:id/attachments`\n       - `GET /api/audit-logs`\n       - `POST /api/projects/:id/archive`\n       - `POST /api/simulation/redistribute/apply`\n       - `GET /api/database/backup`\n       - `GET / POST /api/settings/weights`\n   - **Client API (`/src/api/client.ts`) & Types (`/src/types/index.ts`)**:\n     - Added typed interfaces: `Discussion`, `PeerKudos`, `TaskAttachment`, `ProjectInvitation`.\n     - Added client methods: `resetPassword`, `updateProfile`, `getInvitations`, `createInvitation`, `getDiscussions`, `createDiscussion`, `getKudos`, `sendKudos`, `getTaskAttachments`, `addTaskAttachment`, `deleteTaskAttachment`, `getAuditLogs`, `archiveProject`, `applyRedistribution`, `getDatabaseBackupUrl`, `getCustomWeights`, `saveCustomWeights`.\n   - **Frontend Components Created / Updated**:\n     - `src/components/auth/AuthModal.tsx`: Added \"Reset Password\" tab with password reset flow.\n     - `src/components/auth/UserProfileModal.tsx` (NEW): Full user profile and identity editor with password change, GitHub handle, and role permissions.\n     - `src/components/team/TeamInvitationsModal.tsx` (NEW): Team invitation generator with role selection, expiry tokens, and copy-link functionality.\n     - `src/components/auth/RolePermissionsModal.tsx` (NEW): Detailed RBAC matrix modal comparing Admin vs Manager vs Member capabilities.\n     - `src/components/collaboration/CollaborationPage.tsx` (NEW): Complete team collaboration hub with 4 tabs: Discussions, Meeting Minutes & Action Items, Peer Kudos (invisible work recognition), and Automated Daily Stand-up Generator.\n     - `src/components/simulation/SimulationPage.tsx` (NEW): What-If Simulator with deadline shifting slider, capacity scaling, automated recovery plan runbook, cascading ripple effect prediction, single-point-of-failure detector, and 1-click smart task redistribution.\n     - `src/components/tasks/TasksPage.tsx`: Added interactive **Calendar View** (monthly deliverables grid with task chips), **Timeline / Gantt View** (horizontal duration bars with dependency badges), and prerequisite task dependency selector in the Create Issue modal.\n     - `src/components/tasks/JiraIssueDetailModal.tsx`: Added \"Attachments & Deliverable Assets\" file sharing section with add/delete/simulated download.\n     - `src/components/projects/ProjectsPage.tsx`: Added Project Templates modal (instantiating projects from 4 architectural patterns), Objectives viewer & editor, Project Archiving (filter active/archived/all with restore toggle), and Chronological Audit History modal.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - The original Python `/backend` directory was successfully purged in turn 1 per migration instructions.\n   - `src/utils/pmIntelligence.ts` had a TypeScript type error with `CriticalPathTask` which was resolved; `npm run lint` (`tsc --noEmit`) now passes cleanly.\n   - All 16 automated tests in `src/utils/*.test.ts` and `tests/github-parser.test.mjs` pass.\n\n4. **Active Context**\n   - All backend routes, new SQLite tables, client methods, and new UI pages (`CollaborationPage`, `SimulationPage`, `UserProfileModal`, `TeamInvitationsModal`, `RolePermissionsModal`) have been written and tested.\n   - We need to wire `CollaborationPage` and `SimulationPage` into `Sidebar.tsx` navigation, and expose `UserProfileModal`, `TeamInvitationsModal`, and `RolePermissionsModal` into `App.tsx` and `TopBar.tsx`.\n   - We also need to add the Dispute Resolution UI & Missing Evidence widget into `ContributionsPage.tsx`, enhance `SettingsPage.tsx` with Custom Weights & Audit Trail & Database Backup, and add role-based views (PM vs Member vs Admin) into `DashboardPage.tsx`.\n\n5. **Next Steps (Priority Order)**\n   1. **Update `src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx`**:\n      - Add `\'collaboration\'` and `\'simulation\'` to `ActivePage` union type and `navItems` list (icons: `MessageSquare` and `Sliders` or `Sparkles`).\n      - Connect \"Account\" or user footer to open `UserProfileModal`.\n   2. **Update `src/App.tsx`**:\n      - Import `CollaborationPage`, `SimulationPage`, `UserProfileModal`, `TeamInvitationsModal`, and `RolePermissionsModal`.\n      - Add routing cases for `activePage === \'collaboration\'` and `activePage === \'simulation\'`.\n      - Wire modals and trigger buttons.\n   3. **Enhance `src/components/contributions/ContributionsPage.tsx`**:\n      - Add Missing Evidence detection widget (tasks in \'Done\' without commits/PRs/reviews).\n      - Add Dispute Resolution modal & list (filing disputes with evidence URL, manager resolution).\n      - Add breakdown pills for Testing, Bug Fixes, Code, Design, Documentation, and Peer Kudos.\n   4. **Enhance `src/components/settings/SettingsPage.tsx`**:\n      - Add tabs: \"GitHub Integration\", \"Custom Contribution Weights\" (sliders for high-priority weight, PR/commit value), \"System Audit Trail\", \"Data Backup & Recovery\" (download JSON backup button), and \"Role Permissions Matrix\".\n   5. **Enhance `src/components/dashboard/DashboardPage.tsx`**:\n      - Add Role Switcher dropdown: \"Project Manager Dashboard\" (default), \"My Work / Team Member Dashboard\" (filtered to current user tasks/deadlines/assigned reviews), \"Admin / System Dashboard\".\n      - Add Workload Heatmap grid and Health Score composite gauge.\n   6. **Run Verification**:\n      - Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` to ensure zero compilation or TypeScript errors.\n      - Restart dev server if needed and verify health check.\n\n6. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Strict adherence to the 18 feature domains requested by the user.\n   - All data is real and persisted in SQLite (`platform_database.sqlite`).\n   - Tailwind styling with clean aesthetics, high contrast, zero-pill discipline, tabular figures for numeric metrics.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_end: 246
    user_requests: "Here is the full initial file tree for the application:\n/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/a3f62051-b81f-4c05-897f-3dc17ace47c9/.tempmediaStorage/media_1792679277143_11d236c3.png\n/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/a3f62051-b81f-4c05-897f-3dc17ace47c9/.tempmediaStorage/media_1792679365168_d1a42abe.png\n/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/a3f62051-b81f-4c05-897f-3dc17ace47c9/.tempmediaStorage/media_1792679395194_9a24e1a7.png\n/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/a3f62051-b81f-4c05-897f-3dc17ace47c9/.tempmediaStorage/media_1792679419228_396957d0.png\n/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/a3f62051-b81f-4c05-897f-3dc17ace47c9/.tempmediaStorage/media_1792679458629_0beef6ac.png\n/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/a3f62051-b81f-4c05-897f-3dc17ace47c9/.tempmediaStorage/media_1792679495004_bfa6b291.png\n/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/a3f62051-b81f-4c05-897f-3dc17ace47c9/.tempmediaStorage/media_1792679538743_0fa6c17e.png\n/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/a3f62051-b81f-4c05-897f-3dc17ace47c9/.tempmediaStorage/media_1792679585704_ca9d3653.png\n/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/a3f62051-b81f-4c05-897f-3dc17ace47c9/.tempmediaStorage/media_1792679691818_18c213e1.png\n/.env.example\n/.gitignore\n/README.md\n/backend/database.py\n/backend/models.py\n/backend/requirements.txt\n/backend/routers/__init__.py\n/backend/routers/dashboard.py\n/backend/routers/github.py\n/backend/routers/projects.py\n/backend/routers/reports.py\n/backend/routers/tasks.py\n/backend/schemas.py\n/backend/seed.py\n/backend/services/__init__.py\n/backend/services/__pycache__/__init__.cpython-310.pyc\n/backend/services/__pycache__/contribution_calculator.cpython-310.pyc\n/backend/services/__pycache__/risk_engine.cpython-310.pyc\n/backend/services/github_service.py\n/backend/test_backend.py\n/drag_test_result.png\n/index.html\n/metadata.json\n/package.json\n/platform_database.sqlite\n/server.ts\n/src/App.tsx\n/src/api/client.ts\n/src/components/ai/AIAssistantDrawer.tsx\n/src/components/auth/AuthModal.tsx\n/src/components/common/ConfirmDialog.tsx\n/src/components/common/Modal.tsx\n/src/components/contributions/ContributionsPage.tsx\n/src/components/dashboard/DashboardPage.tsx\n/src/components/github/MemberGitHubModal.tsx\n/src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx\n/src/components/layout/TopBar.tsx\n/src/components/projects/ProjectLeaderModal.tsx\n/src/components/projects/ProjectsPage.tsx\n/src/components/reports/ReportsPage.tsx\n/src/components/risks/RisksPage.tsx\n/src/components/settings/SettingsPage.tsx\n/src/components/tasks/JiraIssueDetailModal.tsx\n/src/components/tasks/TasksPage.tsx\n/src/components/team/TeamPage.tsx\n/src/index.css\n/src/main.tsx\n/src/types/index.ts\n/src/utils/contribution.test.ts\n/src/utils/contribution.ts\n/src/utils/csv.test.ts\n/src/utils/csv.ts\n/src/utils/pmIntelligence.test.ts\n/src/utils/pmIntelligence.ts\n/src/utils/risk.test.ts\n/src/utils/risk.ts\n/tests/github-parser.test.mjs\n/tsconfig.json\n/vite.config.ts\n\nThe following dependencies are installed:\n@google/genai: ^2.4.0\n@tailwindcss/vite: ^4.3.3\n@types/sql.js: ^1.4.11\n@vitejs/plugin-react: ^6.1.1\ndotenv: ^17.2.3\nexpress: ^4.21.2\nlucide-react: ^0.546.0\nmotion: ^12.23.24\nreact: ^19.0.1\nreact-dom: ^19.0.1\nrecharts: ^3.10.1\nsql.js: ^1.15.1\nvite: ^8.3.0\n\nThe following devDependencies are installed:\n@types/express: ^4.17.21\n@types/node: ^22.14.0\n@types/react: ^19.3.0\n@types/react-dom: ^19.3.0\nautoprefixer: ^10.4.21\nesbuild: ^0.25.0\ntailwindcss: ^4.3.3\ntsx: ^4.21.0\ntypescript: ^7.0.2\n\nKey file contents:\n\n--- /.env.example ---\n```\nDATABASE_URL=\nGITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN=\n```\n\n--- /index.html ---\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>Intelligent Project Management & Team Contribution Platform</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Manage projects, assign tasks, track progress, analyze team member contributions, identify project risks with transparent rules, and generate actionable reports.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Intelligent Project Management & Team Contribution Platform\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Manage projects, assign tasks, track progress, analyze team member contributions, identify project risks with transparent rules, and generate actionable reports.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n    <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.tsx\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n\n\n```\n\n--- /metadata.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Intelligent Project Management & Team Contribution Platform\",\n  \"description\": \"Manage projects, assign tasks, track progress, analyze team member contributions, identify project risks with transparent rules, and generate actionable reports.\",\n  \"requestFramePermissions\": [],\n  \"majorCapabilities\": [\"MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API\"]\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/App.tsx ---\n```typescript\nimport React, { useState, useEffect, useCallback } from \'react\';\nimport { Sidebar, ActivePage } from \'./components/layout/Sidebar\';\nimport { TopBar } from \'./components/layout/TopBar\';\nimport { DashboardPage } from \'./components/dashboard/DashboardPage\';\nimport { ProjectsPage } from \'./components/projects/ProjectsPage\';\nimport { TasksPage } from \'./components/tasks/TasksPage\';\nimport { TeamPage } from \'./components/team/TeamPage\';\nimport { ContributionsPage } from \'./components/contributions/ContributionsPage\';\nimport { RisksPage } from \'./components/risks/RisksPage\';\nimport { ReportsPage } from \'./components/reports/ReportsPage\';\nimport { SettingsPage } from \'./components/settings/SettingsPage\';\nimport { AIAssistantDrawer } from \'./components/ai/AIAssistantDrawer\';\nimport { Modal } from \'./components/common/Modal\';\nimport { AuthModal } from \'./components/auth/AuthModal\';\nimport { MemberGitHubModal } from \'./components/github/MemberGitHubModal\';\nimport { ProjectLeaderModal } from \'./components/projects/ProjectLeaderModal\';\nimport { api } from \'./api/client\';\nimport {\n  Project,\n  Task,\n  TeamMember,\n  DashboardMetrics,\n  MemberContribution,\n  ProjectRisk,\n  TaskPriority,\n  TaskStatus,\n  User\n} from \'./types\';\nimport { AlertCircle, CheckCircle2 } from \'lucide-react\';\n\nexport default function App() {\n  const [activePage, setActivePage] = useState<ActivePage>(\'dashboard\');\n  const [selectedProjectId, setSelectedProjectId] = useState<string>(\'\');\n  const [mobileMenuOpen, setMobileMenuOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [isAIOpen, setIsAIOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [isQuickCreateTaskOpen, setIsQuickCreateTaskOpen] = useState(false);\n\n  // Per-member GitHub & Project Leader Modals\n  const [isGitHubModalOpen, setIsGitHubModalOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [isLeaderModalOpen, setIsLeaderModalOpen] = useState(false);\n\n  // Authentication State\n  const [currentUser, setCurrentUser] = useState<User | null>(null);\n  const [isAuthModalOpen, setIsAuthModalOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [authModalMode, setAuthModalMode] = useState<\'login\' | \'register\'>(\'login\');\n\n  // Application Data States\n  const [projects, setProjects] = useState<Project[]>([]);\n  const [tasks, setTasks] = useState<Task[]>([]);\n  const [team, setTeam] = useState<TeamMember[]>([]);\n  const [metrics, setMetrics] = useState<DashboardMetrics | null>(null);\n  const [contributions, setContributions] = useState<MemberContribution[]>([]);\n  const [risks, setRisks] = useState<ProjectRisk[]>([]);\n\n  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [isReseeding, setIsReseeding] = useState(false);\n  const [globalError, setGlobalError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [oauthNotice, setOauthNotice] = useState<string | null>(null);\n\n  // Check for GitHub OAuth callback query param\n  useEffect(() => {\n    try {\n      const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n      if (params.get(\'github_oauth\') === \'connected\') {\n        setOauthNotice(\'GitHub account successfully authenticated & synchronized with your user profile!\');\n        window.history.replaceState({}, \'\', window.location.pathname);\n        setTimeout(() => setOauthNotice(null), 6000);\n      }\n    } catch {\n      // Ignore URL errors\n    }\n  }, []);\n\n  // Quick Task Modal form fields\n  const [quickTitle, setQuickTitle] = useState(\'\');\n  const [quickDescription, setQuickDescription] = useState(\'\');\n  const [quickProjectId, setQuickProjectId] = useState(\'\');\n  const [quickPriority, setQuickPriority] = useState<TaskPriority>(\'Medium\');\n  const [quickStatus, setQuickStatus] = useState<TaskStatus>(\'To Do\');\n  const [quickDueDate, setQuickDueDate] = useState(\'\');\n  const [quickAssigneeId, setQuickAssigneeId] = useState(\'\');\n\n  // Primary data loader\n  const loadAllData = useCallback(async () => {\n    try {\n      setGlobalError(null);\n      const [pRes, tRes, tmRes, mRes, cRes, rRes, meRes] = await Promise.all([\n        api.getProjects(),\n        api.getTasks(),\n        api.getTeam(),\n        api.getDashboard(selectedProjectId || undefined),\n        api.getContributions(selectedProjectId || undefined),\n        api.getRisks(selectedProjectId || undefined),\n        api.getMe().catch(() => ({ user: null }))\n      ]);\n\n      setProjects(pRes);\n      setTasks(tRes);\n      setTeam(tmRes);\n      setMetrics(mRes);\n      setContributions(cRes);\n      setRisks(rRes);\n      if (meRes?.user) {\n        setCurrentUser(meRes.user);\n      }\n    } catch (err: any) {\n      console.error(\'Failed to load application data:\', err);\n      setGlobalError(err.message || \'Error loading platform records.\');\n    } finally {\n      setIsLoading(false);\n    }\n  }, [selectedProjectId]);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    loadAllData();\n  }, [loadAllData]);\n\n  // Auth Actions\n  const handleAuthSuccess = (user: User) => {\n    setCurrentUser(user);\n    loadAllData();\n  };\n\n  const handleLogout = () => {\n    api.logout();\n    setCurrentUser(null);\n    setIsAuthModalOpen(true);\n    setAuthModalMode(\'login\');\n  };\n\n  const handleOpenAuth = (mode: \'login\' | \'register\' = \'login\') => {\n    setAuthModalMode(mode);\n    setIsAuthModalOpen(true);\n  };\n\n  // Project Actions\n  const handleCreateProject = async (data: Partial<Project>) => {\n    await api.createProject(data);\n    await loadAllData();\n  };\n\n  const handleUpdateProject = async (id: string, data: Partial<Project>) => {\n    await api.updateProject(id, data);\n    await loadAllData();\n  };\n\n  const handleDeleteProject = async (id: string) => {\n    await api.deleteProject(id);\n    if (selectedProjectId === id) {\n      setSelectedProjectId(\'\');\n    }\n    await loadAllData();\n  };\n\n  // Task Actions\n  const handleCreateTask = async (data: Partial<Task>) => {\n    await api.createTask(data);\n    await loadAllData();\n  };\n\n  const handleUpdateTask = async (id: string, data: Partial<Task>) => {\n    await api.updateTask(id, data);\n    await loadAllData();\n  };\n\n  const handleDeleteTask = async (id: string) => {\n    await api.deleteTask(id);\n    await loadAllData();\n  };\n\n  // Team Actions\n  const handleCreateMember = async (data: Partial<TeamMember>) => {\n    await api.createTeamMember(data);\n    await loadAllData();\n  };\n\n  const handleUpdateMember = async (id: string, data: Partial<TeamMember>) => {\n    await api.updateTeamMember(id, data);\n    await loadAllData();\n  };\n\n  const handleDeleteMember = async (id: string) => {\n    await api.deleteTeamMember(id);\n    await loadAllData();\n  };\n\n  // Reseed DB action\n  const handleReseedData = async () => {\n    setIsReseeding(true);\n    try {\n      await api.resetAndSeedData();\n      await loadAllData();\n    } catch (err: any) {\n      alert(`Failed to reset database: ${err.message}`);\n    } finally {\n      setIsReseeding(false);\n    }\n  };\n\n  // Quick Task Submit\n... (truncated)\n```\n\n--- /src/index.css ---\n```css\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n@layer base {\n  body {\n    font-family: \'Plus Jakarta Sans\', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, sans-serif;\n    background-color: #f8fafc;\n    color: #0f172a;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n\n  code, pre, .font-mono, .tabular-nums {\n    font-family: \'JetBrains Mono\', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  }\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/main.tsx ---\n```typescript\nimport {createRoot} from \'react-dom/client\';\nimport App from \'./App.tsx\';\nimport \'./index.css\';\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById(\'root\')!).render(<App />);\n\n```\n\n--- /tsconfig.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"experimentalDecorators\": true,\n    \"useDefineForClassFields\": false,\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"types\": [\"vite/client\"],\n    \"lib\": [\n      \"ES2022\",\n      \"DOM\",\n      \"DOM.Iterable\"\n    ],\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"moduleDetection\": \"force\",\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\n        \"./*\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  },\n  \"exclude\": [\"dist\"]\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /vite.config.ts ---\n```typescript\nimport tailwindcss from \'@tailwindcss/vite\';\nimport react from \'@vitejs/plugin-react\';\nimport path from \'path\';\nimport {defineConfig} from \'vite\';\n\nexport default defineConfig(() => {\n  return {\n    plugins: [react(), tailwindcss()],\n    resolve: {\n      alias: {\n        \'@\': path.resolve(__dirname, \'.\'),\n      },\n    },\n    server: {\n      allowedHosts: true as true,\n      host: \'0.0.0.0\',\n      // HMR is disabled in AI Studio via DISABLE_HMR env var.\n      // Do not modify\342\200\224file watching is disabled to prevent flickering during agent edits.\n      hmr: process.env.DISABLE_HMR !== \'true\',\n      // Disable file watching when DISABLE_HMR is true to save CPU during agent edits.\n      watch: process.env.DISABLE_HMR === \'true\' ? null : {},\n    },\n  };\n});\n\n```"
