    thinking: "**Revising Sidebar.tsx**\n\nI\'m currently updating `Sidebar.tsx`. I\'ve imported `MessageSquare` and `Sliders` from `lucide-react`. I\'ve also added `onOpenProfile` to destructuring. I\'m now integrating the new items, including \"Dashboard\", into the `navItems` array, configuring their respective icons.\n\n\n"
