  planner_response {
    response: "### Platform Architecture & Missing Features Implementation Summary\n\nAll 18 functional domains from your matrix have been audited, designed, wired to persistent SQLite storage, and connected into the application.\n\n---\n\n### Key Completed Implementations\n\n1. **User & Access Management (RBAC & Identity)**\n   - **User Profile Modal (`UserProfileModal.tsx`)**: Full profile manager supporting password changes, personal avatar, GitHub handle mapping, and role assignment.\n   - **Password Reset Flow**: Integrated into `AuthModal.tsx` and backed by `/api/auth/reset-password`.\n   - **Role-Based Access Matrix (`RolePermissionsModal.tsx`)**: Comprehensive capability matrix modal comparing Admin vs Manager vs Member privilege tiers.\n   - **Team Invitations (`TeamInvitationsModal.tsx`)**: Generates verifiable invitation tokens with configurable expiration and roles, backed by `/api/invitations`.\n\n2. **Team Collaboration & Invisible Work Recognition (`CollaborationPage.tsx`)**\n   - **Discussions & Mentions**: Threaded team discussions with categorized topics (Architecture, Sprint Planning, Bugs, General).\n   - **Meeting Notes & Action Items**: Structured minutes generator with attendee tracking and bulleted action item lists.\n   - **Peer Kudos**: Explicit recognition mechanism for unrecorded, \"invisible\" labor (mentorship, incident response, pair programming, documentation).\n   - **Automated Daily Stand-up Generator**: 1-click summary generator compiling yesterday\342\200\231s completed deliverables, today\342\200\231s active work, and logged blockers.\n\n3. **Simulation & Project Recovery Engine (`SimulationPage.tsx`)**\n   - **What-If Simulator**: Interactive sliders for deadline shifts (days) and capacity scaling factors (0.5x to 2.0x).\n   - **Cascading Ripple Effect & Single-Point-of-Failure**: Detects overload bottlenecks and predicts schedule slippage across dependent task chains.\n   - **Automated Recovery Plan Runbook**: Multi-step prioritized mitigation recommendations.\n   - **1-Click Smart Task Redistribution**: Suggests reallocations from overloaded to under-allocated contributors with immediate SQLite persistence (`/api/simulation/redistribute/apply`).\n\n4. **Contribution Tracking & Fair Output Analysis (`ContributionsPage.tsx`)**\n   - **Confidence Score & Missing Evidence Detector**: Evaluates verification signals (commits, PRs, review sign-offs) to score auditing confidence.\n   - **Dispute Resolution Flow**: Contributor claim submission modal with category tags, external justification URLs, and manager arbitration actions.\n   - **Expandable Member Performance Ledger**: Granular breakdown displaying task priority multipliers (3x/2x/1x), calculation notes, and real GitHub commits/PRs.\n\n5. **Multi-Role Dashboards & Health Analytics (`DashboardPage.tsx`)**\n   - **Persona Switcher**: Seamless toggle between **Project Manager View** (cross-project risks, deliverable velocity), **Team Member View** (personal backlog, deadlines, completion rate), and **Admin & Org Health View** (system velocity, SQLite foreign key diagnostics).\n   - **Team Workload Heatmap**: Visual matrix highlighting capacity load, overdue risk flags, and engineer distribution.\n   - **Composite Platform Health Score**: Live 0\342\200\223100 delivery gauge tracking milestone adherence and risk penalties.\n\n6. **Interactive Schedules & Jira Workflow Details (`TasksPage.tsx`)**\n   - **Calendar View**: Deliverables grid organizing task commitments by due date with 1-click iCal (`.ics`) export.\n   - **Gantt / Timeline View**: Horizontal duration bars with dependency prerequisite badges.\n   - **Deliverable File Attachments**: Upload and track artifact attachments directly on Jira issue detail cards.\n\n7. **System Settings, Custom Weights & Disaster Recovery (`SettingsPage.tsx`)**\n   - **Custom Weight Sliders**: Configurable multipliers for high priority tasks, PR points, commit points, and peer kudos, persisted via `/api/settings/weights`.\n   - **Audit Trail Inspector**: Real-time chronological audit trail of all project events, task transitions, and user actions.\n   - **Data Backup & Recovery**: 1-click snapshot export of the SQLite database in JSON format."
    modified_response: "### Platform Architecture & Missing Features Implementation Summary\n\nAll 18 functional domains from your matrix have been audited, designed, wired to persistent SQLite storage, and connected into the application.\n\n---\n\n### Key Completed Implementations\n\n1. **User & Access Management (RBAC & Identity)**\n   - **User Profile Modal (`UserProfileModal.tsx`)**: Full profile manager supporting password changes, personal avatar, GitHub handle mapping, and role assignment.\n   - **Password Reset Flow**: Integrated into `AuthModal.tsx` and backed by `/api/auth/reset-password`.\n   - **Role-Based Access Matrix (`RolePermissionsModal.tsx`)**: Comprehensive capability matrix modal comparing Admin vs Manager vs Member privilege tiers.\n   - **Team Invitations (`TeamInvitationsModal.tsx`)**: Generates verifiable invitation tokens with configurable expiration and roles, backed by `/api/invitations`.\n\n2. **Team Collaboration & Invisible Work Recognition (`CollaborationPage.tsx`)**\n   - **Discussions & Mentions**: Threaded team discussions with categorized topics (Architecture, Sprint Planning, Bugs, General).\n   - **Meeting Notes & Action Items**: Structured minutes generator with attendee tracking and bulleted action item lists.\n   - **Peer Kudos**: Explicit recognition mechanism for unrecorded, \"invisible\" labor (mentorship, incident response, pair programming, documentation).\n   - **Automated Daily Stand-up Generator**: 1-click summary generator compiling yesterday\342\200\231s completed deliverables, today\342\200\231s active work, and logged blockers.\n\n3. **Simulation & Project Recovery Engine (`SimulationPage.tsx`)**\n   - **What-If Simulator**: Interactive sliders for deadline shifts (days) and capacity scaling factors (0.5x to 2.0x).\n   - **Cascading Ripple Effect & Single-Point-of-Failure**: Detects overload bottlenecks and predicts schedule slippage across dependent task chains.\n   - **Automated Recovery Plan Runbook**: Multi-step prioritized mitigation recommendations.\n   - **1-Click Smart Task Redistribution**: Suggests reallocations from overloaded to under-allocated contributors with immediate SQLite persistence (`/api/simulation/redistribute/apply`).\n\n4. **Contribution Tracking & Fair Output Analysis (`ContributionsPage.tsx`)**\n   - **Confidence Score & Missing Evidence Detector**: Evaluates verification signals (commits, PRs, review sign-offs) to score auditing confidence.\n   - **Dispute Resolution Flow**: Contributor claim submission modal with category tags, external justification URLs, and manager arbitration actions.\n   - **Expandable Member Performance Ledger**: Granular breakdown displaying task priority multipliers (3x/2x/1x), calculation notes, and real GitHub commits/PRs.\n\n5. **Multi-Role Dashboards & Health Analytics (`DashboardPage.tsx`)**\n   - **Persona Switcher**: Seamless toggle between **Project Manager View** (cross-project risks, deliverable velocity), **Team Member View** (personal backlog, deadlines, completion rate), and **Admin & Org Health View** (system velocity, SQLite foreign key diagnostics).\n   - **Team Workload Heatmap**: Visual matrix highlighting capacity load, overdue risk flags, and engineer distribution.\n   - **Composite Platform Health Score**: Live 0\342\200\223100 delivery gauge tracking milestone adherence and risk penalties.\n\n6. **Interactive Schedules & Jira Workflow Details (`TasksPage.tsx`)**\n   - **Calendar View**: Deliverables grid organizing task commitments by due date with 1-click iCal (`.ics`) export.\n   - **Gantt / Timeline View**: Horizontal duration bars with dependency prerequisite badges.\n   - **Deliverable File Attachments**: Upload and track artifact attachments directly on Jira issue detail cards.\n\n7. **System Settings, Custom Weights & Disaster Recovery (`SettingsPage.tsx`)**\n   - **Custom Weight Sliders**: Configurable multipliers for high priority tasks, PR points, commit points, and peer kudos, persisted via `/api/settings/weights`.\n   - **Audit Trail Inspector**: Real-time chronological audit trail of all project events, task transitions, and user actions.\n   - **Data Backup & Recovery**: 1-click snapshot export of the SQLite database in JSON format."
