  planner_response {
    response: "The public Front Page has been implemented and integrated into the application lifecycle according to your specifications:\n\n### What Was Built:\n\n1. **Dedicated Front/Landing Page (`src/components/landing/FrontPage.tsx`)**:\n   - **Top Navigation Bar (Top-Right Buttons)**: \n     - **\"Log In\"** button: Opens the authentication modal in sign-in mode.\n     - **\"Register\"** button: Primary high-contrast button that opens the registration modal.\n     - Brand mark on the left and quick navigation links in the center.\n   - **Hero Section**:\n     - Headline: *\"Transform invisible engineering effort into transparent, auditable project momentum.\"*\n     - Clear value proposition and unboxed proof telemetry (`SQLite Write-Ahead Logging \302\267 Cryptographic SHA-256 Hashes \302\267 Deterministic Risk Formulas`).\n     - Action buttons to **\"Create Workspace Account\"** and **\"Explore Live Workspace Demo\"**.\n   - **Interactive Live Preview Canvas**:\n     - **Fair Contribution Ledger**: Displays algorithmic contributor weighting (commits, code reviews, architectural kudos, backlog velocity).\n     - **GitHub & Backlog Sync**: Real-time git commit SHA reconciliation with issue tickets.\n     - **Ripple Simulator**: Interactive slider showing cascading milestone delay impact and critical path blast radius.\n   - **Enterprise Capabilities & Architecture Showcase**: Details on SQLite WAL, RBAC, and deterministic scoring.\n   - **Conversion Block & Quiet Footer**: Additional access points to register, log in, or launch the demo workspace.\n\n2. **Application Lifecycle Integration (`src/App.tsx`)**:\n   - **Initial Visit**: When visitors first open the site without an active session, they land on the Front Page.\n   - **Top-Right CTAs**: Clicking **\"Log In\"** or **\"Register\"** opens the modal directly over the Front Page. Upon successful authentication, they transition smoothly into their active workspace.\n   - **Log Out Flow**: Clicking **\"Sign Out\"** clears the session and returns the user to the Front Page.\n   - **Guest Sandbox Flow**: Visitors can click **\"Explore Live Workspace Demo\"** to tour the workspace. While in guest mode, breadcrumbs and top-bar actions provide direct options to return to the Front Page or sign in at any time."
