  user_input {
    user_response: "## Updated Project Requirements\n\n1. **Merge Manager and Admin Roles into Team Leader**\n   - Remove the separate Manager and Admin roles.\n   - Combine all the permissions, responsibilities, and features of both roles into the Team Leader role.\n\n2. **Update the Login and Sign-Up Pages**\n   - Remove the separate Reset Password section from the Login and Sign-Up pages.\n   - Add a **\342\200\234Forgot Password?\342\200\235** link on the right side, directly below the password field on the Sign-In page.\n   - Allow users to reset their passwords through this link.\n\n3. **Team Leader Permissions**\n   - The Team Leader should be the user who created the project.\n   - The Team Leader should have the ability to transfer project leadership to another team member.\n   - After the transfer, the selected member should become the new Team Leader and receive all associated permissions.\n\n4. **Team Member Work Status Tracking**\n   - Team members should be able to view and update the status of their assigned tasks.\n   - Each task should have the following status options:\n     - **Not Started:** The assigned work has not yet begun.\n     - **In Progress:** The assigned work is currently underway.\n     - **Completed:** The assigned work has been finished.\n   - Team Leaders should be able to monitor each member\342\200\231s assigned work, progress, and completion status."
    items {
      text: "## Updated Project Requirements\n\n1. **Merge Manager and Admin Roles into Team Leader**\n   - Remove the separate Manager and Admin roles.\n   - Combine all the permissions, responsibilities, and features of both roles into the Team Leader role.\n\n2. **Update the Login and Sign-Up Pages**\n   - Remove the separate Reset Password section from the Login and Sign-Up pages.\n   - Add a **\342\200\234Forgot Password?\342\200\235** link on the right side, directly below the password field on the Sign-In page.\n   - Allow users to reset their passwords through this link.\n\n3. **Team Leader Permissions**\n   - The Team Leader should be the user who created the project.\n   - The Team Leader should have the ability to transfer project leadership to another team member.\n   - After the transfer, the selected member should become the new Team Leader and receive all associated permissions.\n\n4. **Team Member Work Status Tracking**\n   - Team members should be able to view and update the status of their assigned tasks.\n   - Each task should have the following status options:\n     - **Not Started:** The assigned work has not yet begun.\n     - **In Progress:** The assigned work is currently underway.\n     - **Completed:** The assigned work has been finished.\n   - Team Leaders should be able to monitor each member\342\200\231s assigned work, progress, and completion status."
    }
  }
}
