  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 2
    session_summary: "<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\nImplement the 4 updated project requirements provided by the user:\n1. **Merge Manager and Admin Roles into Team Leader**:\n   - Eliminate distinct \'Manager\' and \'Admin\' roles across the system.\n   - Combine all permissions, capabilities, and settings into a single **\"Team Leader\"** role (with \'Member\' / \'Team Member\' as standard role).\n2. **Update Login and Sign-Up Pages**:\n   - Remove the separate \"Reset Password\" tab/section from the Auth modal / Login & Sign-Up pages.\n   - Add a clickable **\"Forgot Password?\"** link on the right side directly below the password input on the Sign-In page.\n   - Allow users to reset passwords through this link (e.g., inline transition to an email reset flow/modal).\n3. **Team Leader Permissions**:\n   - The user who creates a project is automatically assigned as its **Team Leader** (e.g., `creator_id` / `leader_id`).\n   - The Team Leader must have the UI capability to transfer project leadership to any team member.\n   - Upon transfer, the selected member becomes the new Team Leader with all associated permissions.\n4. **Team Member Work Status Tracking**:\n   - Tasks must use the 3 explicit statuses:\n     - **Not Started**: The assigned work has not yet begun.\n     - **In Progress**: The assigned work is currently underway.\n     - **Completed**: The assigned work has been finished.\n   - Team members must be able to view and update the status of their assigned tasks.\n   - Team Leaders must have a dedicated view/monitoring dashboard to track each member\'s assigned work, progress (%), and completion status.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Completed in earlier turns**:\n  - Full-stack Vite + React + Express + SQLite3 (`server.ts`) backend running with healthy endpoints (`/api/health`, `/api/tasks`, `/api/projects`, `/api/auth`).\n  - Landing / Front Page (`src/components/landing/FrontPage.tsx`) implemented and integrated into `App.tsx` with TopBar and Sidebar navigation.\n  - Test suite passing (`tests/github-parser.test.mjs`, all tests green).\n- **Currently In Progress**:\n  - Investigated `src/types/index.ts` lines 1\342\200\223100 where `SystemRole`, `ProjectRole`, and `TaskStatus` are declared.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Architecture Mapping\n- **Roles in `src/types/index.ts` & Backend (`server.ts`)**:\n  - `export type SystemRole = \'Admin\' | \'Manager\' | \'Member\';` -> Needs to change to `export type SystemRole = \'Team Leader\' | \'Member\';` (with backward compatibility for existing records).\n  - Check `src/components/auth/AuthModal.tsx` and registration options: Currently offers Admin / Manager / Member selection or radio buttons. Must now only offer **Team Leader** and **Team Member** (or Member).\n  - Check `src/components/auth/RolePermissionsModal.tsx`: Currently shows Admin, Manager, Member tabs. Needs to be simplified to **Team Leader** (combining Admin + Manager permissions: project deletion, member invites, role transfer, repository linking, risk mitigation, audit logs) and **Team Member**.\n  - Check `server.ts`: Auth endpoints (`/api/auth/register`, seed users, default users) set roles `Admin` and `Manager`. Update seeds and default user (`zaidtested@gmail.com`) to `Team Leader`. Update role permission checks (`req.user?.role === \'Admin\' || req.user?.role === \'Manager\'`) to check for `Team Leader` (or tolerate legacy \'Admin\'/\'Manager\').\n- **Password Reset in `AuthModal.tsx`**:\n  - Currently has a tab header or segmented mode for `[\'login\', \'register\', \'reset\']`.\n  - Remove `\'reset\'` from the top tabs/navigation bar so only Login and Sign-Up are primary views.\n  - On the Sign-In tab: directly below the Password input field, place a right-aligned `<button type=\"button\">Forgot Password?</button>` link. Clicking it switches view state to password reset mode with a \"Back to Sign In\" option.\n- **Task Statuses**:\n  - In `src/types/index.ts`: `export type TaskStatus = \'Not Started\' | \'In Progress\' | \'Completed\';` (formerly `\'To Do\' | \'In Progress\' | \'In Review\' | \'Done\'`).\n  - Update Kanban boards, status dropdowns, and filters across `TasksPage.tsx`, `KanbanBoard.tsx`, `TaskCard.tsx`, `TaskDetailsModal.tsx`, `SimulationPage.tsx`, and `server.ts` fixtures/seeds to support:\n    - `Not Started` (replaces `To Do`)\n    - `In Progress`\n    - `Completed` (replaces `Done` and `In Review`)\n  - Ensure compatibility layer for existing tasks with `To Do` or `Done` so they render properly as `Not Started` or `Completed`.\n- **Project Leader Assignment & Transfer**:\n  - When creating a project in `server.ts` or `handleCreateProject`, set `leader_id` and `leader_name` to `currentUser.id` / `currentUser.name` if current user is logged in.\n  - Review `ProjectLeaderModal.tsx` and `ProjectsPage.tsx`: ensure the transfer modal allows transferring leadership to any project member, updating both `leader_id` and granting the new leader `Team Leader` status.\n- **Team Leader Member Tracking Dashboard**:\n  - Check `TeamPage.tsx` and `TasksPage.tsx`: ensure Team Leaders have a dedicated tracking panel or table breakdown displaying:\n    - Member Name & Avatar\n    - Assigned tasks count\n    - Not Started / In Progress / Completed counts\n    - Visual progress bar / completion percentage\n    - Ability to drill down into each member\'s tasks and view/update status.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Active Context\n- **Files directly affected**:\n  - `src/types/index.ts`: update `SystemRole`, `TaskStatus`.\n  - `server.ts`: seed data, auth routes, project creation leader assignment, role validations.\n  - `src/components/auth/AuthModal.tsx`: remove separate reset tab, add \"Forgot Password?\" below password field, update role options on register.\n  - `src/components/auth/RolePermissionsModal.tsx`: combine Manager and Admin into Team Leader.\n  - `src/components/tasks/TasksPage.tsx`, `KanbanBoard.tsx`, `TaskCard.tsx`, `TaskDetailsModal.tsx`: update statuses to `Not Started`, `In Progress`, `Completed`.\n  - `src/components/projects/ProjectLeaderModal.tsx` & `ProjectsPage.tsx`: project creation assigns creator as Team Leader; leader transfer workflow.\n  - `src/components/team/TeamPage.tsx`: member work status tracking and progress overview for Team Leaders.\n- **App state**: Dev server runs on port 3000 via `npm run dev` (`tsx server.ts`).\n\n---\n\n### 5. Next Steps\n1. **Types & Server Updates**:\n   - Update `SystemRole = \'Team Leader\' | \'Member\'` and `TaskStatus = \'Not Started\' | \'In Progress\' | \'Completed\'` in `src/types/index.ts`.\n   - Update `server.ts`: default user seeds (`Team Leader`), task fixture statuses, project creation (`leader_id` defaults to creator), transfer leader endpoint `/api/projects/:id/leader`.\n2. **Auth & Reset Password UI (`AuthModal.tsx`)**:\n   - Remove \"Reset Password\" tab selector.\n   - Insert right-aligned \"Forgot Password?\" button under the password field in Login form.\n   - Add inline password reset step when clicked, with password reset execution and return to login.\n   - Update Register form to only allow \"Team Leader\" and \"Member\" (or auto-assign role).\n3. **Tasks & Status Workflow (`TasksPage.tsx`, `KanbanBoard.tsx`, `TaskDetailsModal.tsx`)**:\n   - Update status columns and select inputs to: `Not Started`, `In Progress`, `Completed`.\n   - Ensure member can update their own task\'s status directly from card or details modal.\n4. **Project Creation & Leadership Transfer (`ProjectsPage.tsx`, `ProjectLeaderModal.tsx`)**:\n   - Ensure project creator is set as initial Team Leader.\n   - Verify leadership transfer reassigns leader role and updates permissions.\n5. **Team Leader Work Status Tracking (`TeamPage.tsx`)**:\n   - Build/enhance the Member Work Status Tracking panel showing each team member\'s assigned tasks, status breakdown (Not Started, In Progress, Completed), and progress meter.\n6. **Verification**:\n   - Run `lint_applet` and `compile_applet`.\n   - Run test suite and check API responses via `run_command`.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Never expose internal IDs, Step IDs, or debug logs in UI.\n- Preserve full existing functionality (GitHub sync, SQLite WAL, CSV export, ripple simulation).\n- Clean Tailwind CSS only; no inline styles or raw alerts.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_start: 246
    included_step_index_end: 334
    user_requests: "i want to create front page from the all which is show whenever the user is start the website and if the user log out they show that page and on the top of the page right side give the login and the registrtion button"
    user_requests: "## Updated Project Requirements\n\n1. **Merge Manager and Admin Roles into Team Leader**\n   - Remove the separate Manager and Admin roles.\n   - Combine all the permissions, responsibilities, and features of both roles into the Team Leader role.\n\n2. **Update the Login and Sign-Up Pages**\n   - Remove the separate Reset Password section from the Login and Sign-Up pages.\n   - Add a **\342\200\234Forgot Password?\342\200\235** link on the right side, directly below the password field on the Sign-In page.\n   - Allow users to reset their passwords through this link.\n\n3. **Team Leader Permissions**\n   - The Team Leader should be the user who created the project.\n   - The Team Leader should have the ability to transfer project leadership to another team member.\n   - After the transfer, the selected member should become the new Team Leader and receive all associated permissions.\n\n4. **Team Member Work Status Tracking**\n   - Team members should be able to view and update the status of their assigned tasks.\n   - Each task should have the following status options:\n     - **Not Started:** The assigned work has not yet begun.\n     - **In Progress:** The assigned work is currently underway.\n     - **Completed:** The assigned work has been finished.\n   - Team Leaders should be able to monitor each member\342\200\231s assigned work, progress, and completion status."
    render_latest_checkpoint: true
    total_subagent_count: 0
  }
