  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Revising Role Structures**\n\nI\'m currently working on merging the Manager and Admin roles into a single \"Team Leader\" role. My focus is on consolidating all permissions, responsibilities, and features previously assigned to the separate roles into this new, unified Team Leader. The goal is to streamline the structure and simplify user access, but it needs to be done meticulously.\n\n\n**Consolidating Role Actions**\n\nNow, I\'m focusing on the \"Team Leader\" and \"Member\" roles, simplifying the structure to just those two. I am updating the login and sign-up pages. I removed the separate \"Reset Password\" section, and added a \"Forgot Password?\" link on the sign-in page to streamline that process. Also, I am now focused on the permissions of Team Leaders: they can transfer project leadership and are the project creators. Team Members can view and update their task statuses, and the Team Leader can monitor their progress.\n\n\n"
