      content: "Task id \"d984f42e-c46d-4385-81d4-ae1b0b9ea03f/task-370\" finished with result:\nCommand output:\n1101:  app.post(\'/api/projects/:id/members\', (req, res) => {1102-    const project = queryOne(\'SELECT * FROM projects WHERE id = ?\', [req.params.id]);1103-    if (!project) return res.status(404).json({ detail: \'Project not found\' });1104-1105-    const { member_id, role, name, email, github_username } = req.body;1106-    let targetMemberId = member_id;1107-    const projectRole = role || \'Senior Developer\';1108-1109-    // If inviting by name and email1110-    if (!targetMemberId && email && name) {1111-      const cleanEmail = email.trim().toLowerCase();1112-      const existing = queryOne(\'SELECT id FROM team_members WHERE LOWER(email) = ?\', [cleanEmail]);1113-      if (existing) {1114-        targetMemberId = existing.id;1115-      } else {1116-        targetMemberId = \'m-\' + Date.now().toString(36) + Math.random().toString(36).substring(2, 6);1117-        const now = new Date().toISOString();1118-        const avatarUrl = `https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/initials/svg?seed=${encodeURIComponent(name.trim())}`;1119-        execute(1120-          `INSERT INTO team_members (id, name, email, role, avatar_url, github_username, created_at, updated_at)1121-           VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?)`,1122-          [targetMemberId, name.trim(), cleanEmail, projectRole, avatarUrl, github_username?.trim() || null, now, now]1123-        );1124-      }1125-    }1126-1127-    if (!targetMemberId) {1128-      return res.status(400).json({ detail: \'Please specify an existing team member or provide both name and email to invite.\' });1129-    }1130-1131-    execute(1132-      `INSERT INTO project_members (project_id, member_id, role) VALUES (?, ?, ?)1133-       ON CONFLICT(project_id, member_id) DO UPDATE SET role = excluded.role`,1134-      [project.id, targetMemberId, projectRole]1135-    );1136---1159:  app.put(\'/api/projects/:id/members/:memberId\', (req, res) => {1160-    const { role } = req.body;1161-    if (!role) return res.status(400).json({ detail: \'Role is required\' });1162-1163-    execute(1164-      `UPDATE project_members SET role = ? WHERE project_id = ? AND member_id = ?`,1165-      [role, req.params.id, req.params.memberId]1166-    );1167-1168-    const member = queryOne(1169-      `SELECT pm.member_id, pm.role, tm.name, tm.email, tm.avatar_url 1170-       FROM project_members pm 1171-       LEFT JOIN team_members tm ON pm.member_id = tm.id 1172-       WHERE pm.project_id = ? AND pm.member_id = ?`,1173-      [req.params.id, req.params.memberId]1174-    );1175-    res.json(member);1176-  });1177-1178:  app.delete(\'/api/projects/:id/members/:memberId\', (req, res) => {1179-    execute(\'DELETE FROM project_members WHERE project_id = ? AND member_id = ?\', [req.params.id, req.params.memberId]);1180-    execute(\'UPDATE tasks SET assignee_id = NULL WHERE project_id = ? AND assignee_id = ?\', [req.params.id, req.params.memberId]);1181-    res.json({ success: true, message: \'Member removed from project.\' });1182-  });1183-1184-  app.delete(\'/api/projects/:id\', (req, res) => {1185-    const project = queryOne(\'SELECT * FROM projects WHERE id = ?\', [req.params.id]);1186-    if (!project) {1187-      return res.status(404).json({ detail: \'Project not found\' });1188-    }1189-    execute(\'DELETE FROM tasks WHERE project_id = ?\', [req.params.id]);1190-    execute(\'DELETE FROM project_members WHERE project_id = ?\', [req.params.id]);1191-    execute(\'DELETE FROM github_integrations WHERE project_id = ?\', [req.params.id]);1192-    execute(\'DELETE FROM github_commits WHERE project_id = ?\', [req.params.id]);1193-    execute(\'DELETE FROM github_pull_requests WHERE project_id = ?\', [req.params.id]);1194-    execute(\'DELETE FROM audit_logs WHERE project_id = ?\', [req.params.id]);1195-    execute(\'DELETE FROM meeting_notes WHERE project_id = ?\', [req.params.id]);1196-    execute(\'DELETE FROM r