  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Team Tasks**\n\nI\'ve been examining `TeamPage.tsx`, specifically lines 278-298. Currently, it determines task completion and pending counts. I calculate completed tasks by filtering for \'Done\' status. It also determines pending by subtracting. I\'m focusing on how this aligns with Requirement 4, the team member work status tracking aspect.\n\n\n**Developing Status Tracking**\n\nI\'m now thinking about how to visualize team member work status and have devised a dedicated dashboard section within `TeamPage.tsx`. This will be prominent for Team Leaders. The dashboard will show assigned tasks counts and breakdowns for \"Not Started\", \"In Progress\", and \"Completed\" statuses, with an overall completion progress bar. A drill-down will display tasks, allowing status updates. I\'ve also thought about a \"My Assigned\" filter in `TasksPage.tsx`.\n\n\n"
