  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Status Updates**\n\nI\'ve realized that the `PUT /api/tasks/:id` endpoint already handles status updates. However, I\'m leaning towards adding a dedicated status endpoint, `PATCH /api/tasks/:id/status`. This new endpoint would receive a JSON payload with the `status` field, accepting options like \'Not Started\', \'In Progress\', or \'Completed\'. This approach seems more focused and explicit.\n\n\n"
