  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Work Status Tracking**\n\nI\'m currently focused on implementing the work status tracking endpoint immediately after the `/api/team` route. I\'ve started defining the structure using TypeScript and am considering the query parameters needed to filter the data. I\'m aiming for a straightforward and efficient solution.\n\n\n**Refining Data Queries**\n\nI\'ve just refined the SQL queries for fetching team member data. I\'ve incorporated conditional logic to handle optional `project_id` filtering for both `team_members` and `tasks` tables. I\'m now efficiently joining data to calculate member-specific task assignments and status overviews. It is now much more efficient, and I have just finished the status overview.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_795958"
