  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Team Leader Assignment**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the assignment and transfer process of the team leader role. The system should automatically assign the project creator as the initial leader. Crucially, the leader must be able to transfer leadership to a different team member, ensuring they inherit all permissions associated with the role upon the transfer.\n\n\n"
