  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Login Flow**\n\nI\'m currently focusing on Requirement 2, specifically updating the login and sign-up pages. My latest consideration involves streamlining the user experience by removing the separate password reset section and integrating a \"Forgot Password?\" link directly on the sign-in page, positioned under the password field. This aims for a more intuitive and efficient flow.\n\n\n**Integrating Password Reset**\n\nI\'ve decided to remove the \"Reset Password\" tab in `AuthModal.tsx`. Instead, I\'m integrating a \"Forgot Password?\" link directly beneath the password input field when the mode is set to \'login\'. I will replace lines 166-179. This will simplify the login experience and allow users to reset their passwords without changing the modal view.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_801077"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Remove reset tab, add Forgot Password link below password field, update roles in AuthModal\", \"EndLine\":327, \"Instruction\":\"Remove reset password tab, add Forgot Password link on right side under password, add back to login link, and update roles to Team Leader and Team Member\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"        {/* Tab switchers - Only Sign In and Register */}\\n        {mode !== \'reset\' ? (\\n          <div className=\\\"flex border-b border-slate-200\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                setMode(\'login\');\\n                setErrorMessage(null);\\n              }}\\n              className={`pb-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 text-xs font-semibold border-b-2 transition-colors ${\\n                mode === \'login\'\\n                  ? \'border-blue-600 text-blue-600\'\\n                  : \'border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              Sign In\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                setMode(\'register\');\\n                setErrorMessage(null);\\n              }}\\n              className={`pb-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 text-xs font-semibold border-b-2 transition-colors ${\\n                mode === \'register\'\\n                  ? \'border-blue-600 text-blue-600\'\\n                  : \'border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              Register\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        ) : (\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 border-b border-slate-200\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-900\\\">Reset Account Password</span>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                setMode(\'login\');\\n                setErrorMessage(null);\\n                setSuccessMessage(null);\\n              }}\\n              className=\\\"text-xs text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 font-semibold hover:underline\\\"\\n            >\\n              \342\206\220 Back to Sign In\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n\\n        {/* Notifications */}\\n        {errorMessage && (\\n          <div className=\\\"p-3 text-xs bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 text-rose-800 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n            <AlertCircle className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-rose-600 shrink-0\\\" />\\n            <span>{errorMessage}</span>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n\\n        {successMessage && (\\n          <div className=\\\"p-3 text-xs bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n            <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0\\\" />\\n            <span>{successMessage}</span>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n\\n        {/* Form */}\\n        <form onSubmit={handleSubmit} className=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n          {mode === \'register\' && (\\n            <>\\n              <div>\\n                <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\\\">\\n                  Full Name *\\n                </label>\\n                <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n                  <UserIcon className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none\\\" />\\n                  <input\\n                    type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                    required\\n                    value={name}\\n                    onChange={(e) => setName(e.target.value)}\\n                    placeholder=\\\"e.g. Zaid Tested\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"w-full pl-9 pr-3 py-2 text-xs text-slate-900 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\\\"\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div>\\n                <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\\\">\\n                  Workspace Role\\n                </label>\\n                <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n                  <Briefcase className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none\\\" />\\n                  <select\\n                    value={role}\\n                    onChange={(e) => setRole(e.target.value)}\\n                    className=\\\"w-full pl-9 pr-3 py-2 text-xs text-slate-900 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <option value=\\\"Team Leader\\\">Team Leader (Project & Team Leadership)</option>\\n                    <option value=\\\"Member\\\">Team Member (Developer / Contributor)</option>\\n                  </select>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </>\\n          )}\\n\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\\\">\\n              Email Address *\\n            </label>\\n            <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n              <Mail className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none\\\" />\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"email\\\"\\n                required\\n                value={email}\\n                onChange={(e) => setEmail(e.target.value)}\\n                placeholder=\\\"name@enterprise.internal\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-full pl-9 pr-3 py-2 text-xs text-slate-900 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1\\\">\\n              {mode === \'reset\' ? \'New Password * (min 6 characters)\' : \'Password * (min 6 characters)\'}\\n            </label>\\n            <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n              <Lock className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none\\\" />\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"password\\\"\\n                required\\n                minLength={6}\\n                value={password}\\n                onChange={(e) => setPassword(e.target.value)}\\n                placeholder=\\\"\342\200\242\342\200\242\342\200\242\342\200\242\342\200\242\342\200\242\342\200\242\342\200\242\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-full pl-9 pr-3 py-2 text-xs text-slate-900 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 font-mono\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n            {/* \\\"Forgot Password?\\\" link on the right side, directly below the password field on the Sign-In page */}\\n            {mode === \'login\' && (\\n              <div className=\\\"flex justify-end mt-1.5\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => {\\n                    setMode(\'reset\');\\n                    setErrorMessage(null);\\n                    setSuccessMessage(null);\\n                  }}\\n                  className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline transition-colors\\\"\\n                >\\n                  Forgot Password?\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"submit\\\"\\n            disabled={isLoading}\\n            className=\\\"w-full mt-2 py-2 px-4 text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 rounded-lg shadow-2xs transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2 disabled:opacity-50\\\"\\n          >\\n            {isLoading ? (\\n              <span>Processing...</span>\\n            ) : (\\n              <>\\n                <span>{mode === \'login\' ? \'Sign In\' : mode === \'register\' ? \'Create Account\' : \'Reset Password\'}</span>\\n                <ArrowRight className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n              </>\\n            )}\\n          </button>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        {/* 1-Click Fast Demo Login for Evaluation */}\\n        <div className=\\\"pt-3 border-t border-slate-100\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500 mb-2\\\">\\n            <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-600\\\" />\\n            <span>Fast 1-Click Demo Profiles (Pre-seeded):</span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              disabled={isLoading}\\n              onClick={() => handleDemoLogin(\'zaidtested@gmail.com\', \'password123\')}\\n              className=\\\"text-left p-2.5 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg transition-colors group\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-blue-600\\\">\\n                Zaid Tested\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"text-[10px] text-blue-700 font-medium\\\">Team Leader</div>\\n              <div className=\\\"text-[9px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-0.5\\\">zaidtested@gmail.com</div>\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              disabled={isLoading}\\n              onClick={() => handleDemoLogin(\'elena.rostova@enterprise.internal\', \'password123\')}\\n              className=\\\"text-left p-2.5 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg transition-colors group\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-blue-600\\\">\\n                Elena Rostova\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"text-[10px] text-blue-700 font-medium\\\">Team Leader</div>\\n              <div className=\\\"text-[9px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-0.5\\\">elena.rostova@enterprise.internal</div>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\", \"StartLine\":137, \"TargetContent\":\"        {/* Tab switchers */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex border-b border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => {\\n              setMode(\'login\');\\n              setErrorMessage(null);\\n            }}\\n            className={`pb-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 text-xs font-semibold border-b-2 transition-colors ${\\n              mode === \'login\'\\n                ? \'border-blue-600 text-blue-600\'\\n                : \'border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Sign In\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => {\\n              setMode(\'register\');\\n              setErrorMessage(null);\\n            }}\\n            className={`pb-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 text-xs font-semibold border-b-2 transition-colors ${\\n              mode === \'register\'\\n                ? \'border-blue-600 text-blue-600\'\\n                : \'border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Register\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => {\\n              setMode(\'reset\');\\n              setErrorMessage(null);\\n            }}\\n            className={`pb-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 text-xs font-semibold border-b-2 transition-colors ${\\n              mode === \'reset\'\\n                ? \'border-blue-600 text-blue-600\'\\n                : \'border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Reset Password\\n          </butt