  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Revising Role Structures**\n\nI\'m currently focused on streamlining our role structure within `RolePermissionsModal.tsx`. The goal is to consolidate the Admin and Manager roles into a new \"Team Leader\" role. This new role will inherit all the capabilities of both existing roles, effectively merging their permissions. The initial step will involve removing the distinct Manager and Admin options to create a single, unified \"Team Leader\" selection.\n\n\n"
